    "<br>\n",
    "\n",
    "### 📝 Lecture Summary\n",
    "- Implementing custom code blocks for specific micro-interactions that default options don't cover.\n",
    "- See the code block cell below for reference snippet configuration.\n",
    "</details>"
   ]
